<section class="section section--tight build-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="calc-breadcrumb"><a href="/calculators/">← All calculators</a></p>
    <span class="eyebrow">Construction</span>
    <h1>You are either buying a finished home, or you are <em>building.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Those are different loans. Start here so you do not open the wrong tool.</p>
    <p>A finished house is one contract and one settlement. A build pays out in stages, while you usually keep paying rent. This page is the map. The cash timeline is only for one of the doors below.</p>
